# =============================================================================
# Contact form email delivery — set ONE of the options below in .env.local
# =============================================================================
#
# Without any provider key, /api/contact returns 503 and the browser falls
# back to opening the visitor's mail client (mailto:). That means emails
# only arrive in your Gmail if the visitor manually clicks "Send" in their
# own mail app — which usually doesn't happen.
#
# To receive every submission automatically in your inbox, configure ONE
# of the three options below, save the file as `.env.local`, then restart
# the dev server (Ctrl+C, `npm run dev`).
#
# After setup, sanity-check by opening:  http://localhost:3000/api/contact
# It should report which providers are active.
#

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Option A — Gmail SMTP (simplest if you already have Gmail)  ⭐ RECOMMENDED
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Enable 2-Step Verification on your Google account:
#    https://myaccount.google.com/security
# 2. Create an App Password (16 chars, no spaces):
#    https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
# 3. Paste it below. Email lands directly in your Gmail.
#
# GMAIL_USER=rajendrakumohanty96@gmail.com
# GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# GMAIL_TO_EMAIL=rajendrakumohanty96@gmail.com  # optional, defaults to GMAIL_USER

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Option B — Resend (best deliverability, free 100/day)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Sign up at https://resend.com
# 2. Create an API key
# 3. NOTE: on the free plan you can only send TO the email you signed up with,
#    until you verify a sending domain. Use the test sender for "From".
#
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# RESEND_FROM_EMAIL=Portfolio Contact <onboarding@resend.dev>
# RESEND_TO_EMAIL=rajendrakumohanty96@gmail.com

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Option C — Web3Forms (zero setup, no account beyond your email)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Visit https://web3forms.com and enter the email you want to receive at.
# 2. Copy the access key they email you.
#
# WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=your-access-key-here
